{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119682","id":3733691275,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ei5uL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119682.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119682","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119682/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119682/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119682/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a3d281166688b32d1995129a167c45bdcc88fabd","number":119682,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix autosmooth behavior change caused by performance fix","user":{"login":"Jesusemora","id":32273722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjczNzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32273722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora","html_url":"https://github.com/Jesusemora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119551 altered the behavior of `autosmooth` when `angle` is `< 0.1`, it was supposed to make the faces flat, but was changed to use the less performant smoothing instead.\r\nThis PR removes a conditional branching, restoring the previous behavior, which was in the original proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1862:\r\n\r\n> If the angle limit is 0 or 180, the smoothing calculation process is skipped since no faces (or all faces) will be considered smooth.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n<table><tr><td>4.7 beta 2</td><td>\r\n<img width=\"973\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Captura desde 2026-05-22 23-23-08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/534a610d-e6d4-4a6f-a3e5-f23b6644cb43\" />\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>performance fix</td><td>\r\n<img width=\"973\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Captura desde 2026-05-22 23-43-15\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56c9f5cf-3a25-4d15-9308-47e657755590\" />\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>this PR</td><td><img width=\"973\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Captura desde 2026-05-22 23-28-44\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b555b7a4-daeb-4d2b-8eef-726be836d82e\" /></td></tr></table>\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`vec_map` was also declared first in `update_shape`, and then again locally in the `_build_surfaces_default()` method. The first declaration was removed as it was doing nothing.\r\n\r\nNo AI used.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repo